import EmailAddress from "../components/EmailAddress.astro";
import Simple from "../layouts/Simple.astro";
---
<Simple
  title="Contact"
  description="Contact the metricspick editors about a correction, a missing source, or a privacy question."
  kicker="Contact"
  lede="The useful notes are corrections: a price that changed, a doc we misread, or a job we assigned to the wrong tool."
  crumbs={[{ href: "/", label: "Home" }, { label: "Contact" }]}
>
  <p>Email the editors at <EmailAddress />. Include a link to the page and the sentence you are questioning.</p>
  <p>A correction about a price should point at the vendor’s current page. Our method and the 24 November 2026 check are explained in <a href="/how-we-test/">how we test</a>. Accessibility barriers can also go to the address on the <a href="/accessibility/">accessibility statement</a>.</p>
  <p>We do not offer setup calls, migrations, or paid placement. Product questions about DataFast itself belong with DataFast. Questions about a comparison belong here. The <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/">affiliate disclosure</a> explains the DataFast links.</p>
</Simple>
